  body" choice modules/fm-service/module.yaml already makes for its own OpenAPI/proto contract
  templates against InterfaceContract.

  Renders against 19 §19.2's own real TemplateContext shape (project/artifact/inputs/style/now/forge),
  matching modules/fm-web/templates/*.md.hbs's own established convention for a template that is not a
  framework's own output_template. Only Handlebars built-in helpers are used (#each, #if) -- no custom
  helper is registered anywhere in this repository yet. `created`/`updated` render `{{{now}}}` through
  a caller-supplied bare-date fixture (@forge/schemas' own baseFrontMatterShape declares both as
  `z.string().date()`, unlike modules/fm-web's own two schemas, which deliberately declare
  `date-time` -- DataModel/Diagram invent no fields of their own, so this template does not either).
--}}
